(?) atom etc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220520/extras/0673d8d23fdcfdde4fc855044e058c64.avif?t=1748579489\" width=300 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique solitaire inspired by Zachtronics's Fortune\u2019s Foundation</p>",
